      "chunk_id": "012bde44db03_0",
      "doc_id": "012bde44db03",
      "text": "Scam. I purchased this phone with confidence because I hadn't ever had a problem with anything purchased before. This was a nightmare of epic proportions. When I got the SIM card and started the activation process, I got a warning box that stayed the phone couldn't be activated and to call Verizon. That is a challenge as well. After two days of trying to get someone to talk to me I got a woman that said they couldn't remove the block because the phone was reported as stolen. When I bought it, it said it was a new phone, in the factory box. I am returning the phone and hoping the seller refunds my purchase price.",
